{"repositoryId":1402146410,"availability":"available","full":"aspershupadhyay/latch","name":"latch","description":"Let any AI app use your Android phone, on your terms. Open-source MCP server and Android app: Claude, ChatGPT and Cursor can see the screen and tap, with per-app permissions, approval for Send and Pay, and a Stop button. No ADB, no laptop. Self-host on Vercel or Docker.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Kotlin","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T17:41:07Z","updated":"2026-10-18T13:09:49Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aspershupadhyay.github.io/latch/","topics":["accessibility-service","agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-agents","android","android-automation","chatgpt","claude","jetpack-compose","kotlin","llm","mcp","mcp-server","mobile-automation","model-context-protocol","phone-automation","privacy","rust","self-hosted","vercel"],"demo":"https://aspershupadhyay.github.io/latch/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:36.812Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:36.812Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:36.812Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:48:36.812Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Let any AI app use your Android phone. On your terms.","Latch is an Android app and a small gateway that you own. Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, or any other MCP app connects to your gateway and can read your screen, tap, type, and move files, but only in the apps you switch on, and never past a payment, a password, or the Stop button. Developers can also switch on full ADB shell access over Wi-Fi.","No cable, no laptop left running, and no Latch server in the middle. Your phone connects out to a gateway on your own free Vercel account or your own server."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aspershupadhyay/latch/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dfb679d0b8ee5994f3ffe488f0f117949dd7ec08fec4dc8a263cfe26df344901","extractedAt":"2